The Volunteer Sign-Up App is a simple and user-friendly application developed using FlutterFlow. It allows individuals who are interested in volunteering to register by providing their personal information. The purpose of this application is to make volunteer registration easier, faster, and more organized.

Features

- Welcome Page – Displays a welcome message and introduces the application.
- Volunteer Registration Form – Allows users to enter their information.
- Full Name – Collects the volunteer's complete name.
- Email Address – Collects the volunteer's email.
- Phone Number – Collects the volunteer's contact number.
- Submit Button – Allows users to submit their registration.
- Success Page – Displays a confirmation message after successful registration.

Technologies Used
- FlutterFlow
- Firebase
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

How to Install and Run

 Open the GitHub repository.
 Click the green Code button.
 Select Download ZIP.
 Extract the downloaded ZIP file.
 Open the project folder using Visual Studio Code.
 Open "index.html".
 Run the website using the Live Server extension.
 Click the Volunteer Sign-Up App link to open the application.

